error_failed(ctm->pending);
> =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0__ofono_dbus_pendi=
ng_reply(&ctm->pending, reply);
> --

Then you might want to change the other similar call sites, too. Using
the following semantic patch, I hopefully found all of them:

// <smpl>
@r1@
struct ofono_error *error;
@@

if (error->type !=3D OFONO_ERROR_TYPE_NO_ERROR) {
...
- DBG
+ ofono_error
...
}
// </smpl>


See patch attached.

regards,
Lucas De Marchi

